  },
  "basis": "Chrome on macOS sends a two-finger scroll as a stream of pixel-mode wheel events every frame whose deltas ramp up and decay, often fractional or below 4 and sometimes with a small cross-axis delta. Since Chromium change 250923004 a pinch arrives as wheel events with ctrlKey set and deltaY = -100 * ln(scale step), so each event is small and fractional. Delta values are modelled, not measured.",
  "todo": "TODO: synthetic, modelled on documented browser behaviour. Replace or complement it with a trace recorded on the real device through browser/page/trace-recorder.html (see the package README).",
